# --- LocalCore AI training artifacts ---
# Keep READMEs, configs, and manifests committed; ignore data and checkpoints.
localcore-ai/**/checkpoints/
localcore-ai/**/data/raw/
localcore-ai/**/data/generated/
localcore-ai/**/data/review/

--- Preserve intentional project documentation ---

Markdown files, source files, blueprints, manifests,

package.json, lockfiles, and configuration templates

are intentionally NOT ignored by these rules.